  "title": "Positional Concepts Inventory",
  "description": "Discovery inventory of positional concepts identified during research. This inventory captures the static and dynamic characteristics of a chess position that influence evaluation. Definitions, evidence, pedagogy, dependencies and learning scenarios are maintained separately within the Canonical Chess Knowledge Base.",
